WEBVTT

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:42.380
The army's main force is still persisting with their search.

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:46.590
Just as I thought. They think we've gone across the border.

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:49.440
So the castle's defenses have been lowered.

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.910
What about Kaito?

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:54.490
His wounds have just healed, so he hasn't moved yet.

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:56.700
Could this be our chance?

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:59.250
Hey, have you finished over there?

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:02.170
We'll be done in a moment.

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:04.230
It's tough, because the doctor isn't here!

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:09.220
Once the castle's garrison is asleep, we'll do it!

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.160
Oh, is that you, Mirano?

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:25.980
How are the others?

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.560
They're resting down below.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:30.450
You should rest for a while too, Princess.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.120
I'm fine.

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:36.500
Geez, they're still working at this time of the night.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.640
They must be very attentive because of their training.

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:43.130
From now on, are our attacks going to be decided by when the lights go out?

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.630
It looks like it, doesn't it?

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:47.710
Mirano.

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:50.450
I've decided on my reward.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:52.110
You can have anything.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.740
Please return that body to me.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:55.710
Huh?

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:58.160
It was originally mine, after all.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:02.050
Using Teoria's power, we can revert back to our original appearances.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:05.400
Then I'll just be a plain old bounty hunter,

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:07.830
and you can go back to being a plain old princess.

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:09.450
Yes.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:13.250
There's one more thing I'd like to ask you.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.490
What's that?

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:17.600
I will keep our promise, without fail.

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:19.450
However,

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.370
if that promise is to be fulfilled,

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:25.360
I will have to cross swords with Kaito for sure.

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:28.910
He will definitely put his life at stake.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:34.110
Mirano, are you prepared to see everything through to the end?

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.140
Well?

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.250
If I wasn't prepared,

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.280
I wouldn't be here.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:54.070
You're terrible at lying.

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:59.940
Anyway, whether we laugh or cry, this is the end.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:03.920
You should accept it and see it through, Alita.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:09.050
Yes, I'll accompany you to the very end, Faris.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.180
Let's go.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.090
Hey, what—

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.700
Dammit. They've changed the layout of the defenses.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.580
So the enemy is pretty tough?

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:46.530
It's easy, isn't it? We just have to kill them.

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:48.670
You promised not to kill anyone.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:50.040
Who's there?

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.790
We've been spotted?

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:54.750
We'll have to alter the plan. Pete, please take care of it.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:55.970
Understood.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:58.140
Hold it!

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:51.430
Pursuers.

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.020
Is it Cecilia?

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.950
No, it isn't. It's the knights.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.360
There's ten to fifteen of them, huh?

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.330
Dammit. The soldiers are spreading out quickly.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:06.540
Master, leave this to Ana and me. You go ahead.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:08.540
You handle the big fish.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:11.030
Sorry.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.830
So you people wanna act violent, eh?

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:19.760
Too bad this won't avenge the doctor.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:23.700
You got it? Don't kill them.

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:24.850
I get it.

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:29.190
Take them down!

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.770
This way is still all right, isn't it?

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:38.410
Wait.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:44.450
I didn't think you were the type to hide.

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:51.580
Yo, we meet again.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:55.210
Don't tell me you've only come to say hello.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:59.280
After you've been beaten to a pulp, you won't be able to run away.

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.280
Especially since I want to ask you...

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.510
This sword, do you remember it?

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.390
You attacked my village.

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:08.430
The villagers,

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:11.590
my family, you killed them.

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:12.880
Why?

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.730
No particular reason.

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:18.150
It was simply because it was there.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:21.500
It didn't matter which village.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:26.700
I just wanted to test out the power I had in my hands. That's all.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:29.870
You bitch! Just for that, my village was...

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.540
Great power is for great people to use.

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:35.500
Don't you think so?

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.590
SHUT UP!!

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:46.280
You're the vital key to Teoria.

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:49.530
If you follow my orders, I won't hurt you,

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.690
but I don't suppose you'd understand that.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:55.770
Don't blame me; it's just my nature.

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:25.390
Dammit, I missed.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.660
I underestimated you a little.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.190
Playtime is over.

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.360
What will you do now?

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:05.980
Don't think you can escape.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.010
There's only one place you can run to.

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:17.730
Behind this door...

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:19.440
is Teoria?

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:26.300
Yes, but the only thing that can open this door is the Princess who is the key.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:31.440
If you go inside and close the door, Cecilia's lot won't be able to enter.

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:35.940
Jodo!

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:47.470
Nii-sama...

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:48.650
Could it be...

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.470
that the two of you have exchanged bodies?

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:40.020
This is... Teoria!

00:10:55.620 --> 00:11:01.170
Now... awaken, Teoria and hear my wish!

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:03.250
Stop it, Nii-sama!

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:19.540
Humanity's cycle of cruel and callous history will be disrupted.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:23.860
This world... Every single living thing in this world,

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:25.110
will be destroyed!

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:30.110
Destroy... the world?

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:37.620
Please! Stop it, Nii-sama!

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.370
Nii-sama!!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:54.430
Sorry, but this thing's use has already been decided upon.

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:02.480
Bitch!

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.390
You're my prize.

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:08.070
Any more useless struggle is a waste.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.240
Don't interfere!

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:21.600
Gramps! You okay?

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:23.200
What the hell happened?

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:27.570
I don't know... The princess... Mirano...

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:29.080
They're not here.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:32.260
The door! What about the door?

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:37.890
You're saying that Master and Kaito are inside there?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.530
Only the Princess can open the door.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:45.900
Since it's like this, the only thing we can do is wait.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.480
Master.

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:58.120
Since Teoria has started up, you're no longer needed.

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:00.910
DIE!!

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:04.000
Princess!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:17.490
This... No way...

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:31.630
Why...

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:33.200
Why...?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:38.720
My... My... My...

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:40.580
My wonderful power is...

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:01.010
Princess!

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:07.660
Teoria has accepted my wish.

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:10.060
No one can stop it now.

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:14.570
Are you hoping for your souls to return to their original places?

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:19.660
Don't worry. When the world is destroyed, that won't be necessary anymore.

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:24.030
Why do you want the world to be destroyed so much?

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:27.110
Do you have any attachment to this world?

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:32.400
War has already destroyed this world once before,

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:34.660
yet humans are still fighting!

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:36.050
Killing!

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:42.300
We are only living by clinging on to the old world's technology.

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:44.930
What value is there in this kind of world?

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.440
Nii-sama.

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:55.030
Therefore, I will destroy the world! Everything will be erased, and then...

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:57.320
the world will be cleansed!

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.280
I'll stop you by force, without fail.

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:06.500
Didn't I tell you? Until the world is destroyed, it will not stop!

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:34.360
Princess!

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:44.620
Why... why are you doing this?!

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:47.120
Now, Teoria...

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:50.330
Show me the final moments of this world!

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:02.560
Princess.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.340
It can't be...

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:22.070
Princess!

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:37.800
Say, in order to protect this country,

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.840
there is a princess who would give up her own life. Did you know that?

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:46.370
A girl who would give everything she had,

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:50.930
so she could wish for people's happiness. Did you know that?

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:52.710
To me, that's the only reason...

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:58.690
why this world is worth protecting.

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:12.240
It opened!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:12.960
Let's go!

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:19.310
Mirano, is there really no way to stop this?

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:24.510
There's definitely no way to stop Teoria.

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:28.810
Something that can't be stopped once it's started moving. This shouldn't exist!

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:31.550
There's only one way.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:33.610
Jodo!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:36.130
A stop switch does exist.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:42.690
Only the princess, the key, can possibly stop Teoria.

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:45.890
Why didn't you say so earlier, Gramps? Let's do it already!

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.320
But...

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:48.200
What is it?

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:56.870
If Teoria is stopped, everything created during the age of Lost Technology will also be terminated.

00:17:57.530 --> 00:17:59.130
So what of it?

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:04.530
In other words, we will disappear along with Teoria.

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:09.360
We, the products of Lost Technology,

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:12.450
have lived this long due to Teoria's power.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:17.730
The end of that power means we will stop functioning.

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.210
What are you saying?

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:23.070
It's all right, Master.

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:25.830
We've already lived too long.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:31.140
By our very nature, we, along with Teoria should not be in this age.

00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:34.940
When the relics of the past have been removed,

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:38.080
the beginning of the age of humans will arrive.

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:41.090
Don't be an idiot! I can't do something like that!

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:43.290
It's the only way.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:49.690
That's the way it has to be. Sorry to have gotten you involved.

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:54.930
However, there is no place for us in this world any more.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.110
Please understand.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:05.940
Bye bye!

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:13.820
Master! Do it!

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:20.330
Master!

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.860
Shut up! I get it. You don't have to tell me!

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:25.870
You damned fool.

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:37.680
This is... fine.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:44.430
Master,

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:46.360
later.

00:19:56.760 --> 00:19:58.370
Master.

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:06.380
It was fun.

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:12.280
Yeah.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:00.980
Why?

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:06.200
I only promised to protect this country, but...

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.110
I haven't received any rewards for my extra work.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:15.160
Furthermore, I don't care whether you live or die,

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:19.920
but... there is someone who cares a lot.

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:21.360
Never forget that.

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:45.410
Princess, we weren't able to fulfill the promise to return our bodies to normal.

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:47.910
It doesn't matter.

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:50.860
Let's carry on like this for a little longer.

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:54.060
We'll find a different way to do it.

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:58.280
Until then, I'll protect this country.

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:00.430
Please do!

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:21.030
It's for a promise. Nothing personal.

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:25.100
Come!

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:27.640
Main forces! Charge!!

00:22:35.640 --> 00:22:39.820
Forland's princess appears on the battlefield;

00:22:39.820 --> 00:22:42.560
all of the enemy nations fear her.

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:47.770
Out of fear and respect, they call this noblewoman...

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:50.040
"Murder Princess".
